{"data": [{"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:23:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116883753914036286"], "id": "2116883753914036286", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2112188776948858880", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116883704010477677", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kenzoWUx5 @DotComParker \u8fd9\u7bc7\u6587\u7ae0\u4ecb\u7ecd\u7528Grok Bot\u505a11\u79cd\u6536\u5165\u6d41\uff1a\u793e\u4ea4\u8d26\u53f7\u63a5\u5e7f\u544a\u3001\u8f6c\u552e\u626b\u63cf\u3001\u65e0\u8138\u5185\u5bb9\u9891\u9053\u3001\u5efa\u7ad9\u670d\u52a1\u3001\u54a8\u8be2\u3001\u6570\u5b57\u4ea7\u54c1\u3001Newsletter\u3001\u672c\u5730\u5ba2\u670d\u673a\u5668\u4eba\u3001\u7b80\u5386\u6539\u5199\u3001\u8f85\u5bfc\u8bfe\u7a0b\u3001\u4eba\u5de5\u5ba1\u6821\u7ffb\u8bd1\u3002", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2116883753914036286"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116882050213117952"]}, "author_id": "54917630", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:16:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116882057771229213"], "id": "2116882057771229213", "in_reply_to_user_id": "13083622", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116831984119054607", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@techAU Having used Grok Bot for several months now, I can suggest some much longer-tail duties that really help to stretch context use.\n\nAs a mandatory, hook it up to some task and context management tools. I\u2019m using ClickUp, and Agentmail as my two main go-to\u2019s. \n\nAs a real-world https://t.co/NHjxQRD4NG", "url": "https://x.com/jdreimanis/status/2116882057771229213"}, {"author_id": "2110386666061832192", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:15:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116881851570876786"], "id": "2116881851570876786", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1095017202930061312", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116584846382313734", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@benjhaberman Calendar reminders for a credit that expires in a year is the bit most of us forget. Royce's Grok Bot dug up a $150 Southwest credit he thought he'd lost. Did Amex give you points back or a travel credit in the end? And did the bot need you for any of it?", "url": "https://x.com/agentsinuse/status/2116881851570876786"}, {"article": {"title": "How to Build Your Own Personal Intelligence System With Grok Bot "}, "author_id": "1355965591702614018", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:13:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116881320282386726"], "id": "2116881320282386726", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 222, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/uE8hTrcmsG", "url": "https://x.com/liam_fallen/status/2116881320282386726"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116881204485967872"]}, "author_id": "1645912570795114497", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:13:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116881234089406926"], "id": "2116881234089406926", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 94, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111897393041932316", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "HOLY SH*T. Someone open-sourced a Grok Bot alternative and it got 1,303 stars today.\n\nOpenMausBot turns your AI agents into contacts in a chat app:\n\u2192 every bot is Claude or Codex running locally\n\u2192 each one gets its own cloud computer with a browser\n\u2192 you text them like friends https://t.co/e0FEJlXfm2 https://t.co/erL9DFZs69", "url": "https://x.com/kyzoroX/status/2116881234089406926"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116880399934586880", "3_2116880827090898944"]}, "author_id": "2095989814449332226", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:12:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116881146596278572"], "id": "2116881146596278572", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "grok @bot got me 135k impressions in 7 days. up 645% from the week before.\n\ni didn't hire anyone. i set up a team of grok bots and gave each one a job title, like a real company.\n\nmy chief posting officer runs the whole operation. chief of staff keeps the daily rhythm and the https://t.co/B6zMiBdFuX", "url": "https://x.com/moneyeducator/status/2116881146596278572"}, {"author_id": "742673143", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:10:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116880629451149374"], "id": "2116880629451149374", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 291, "like_count": 7, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116578058186473912", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I think my Grok Bot is now in perfect state.\n\n- All my emails are 100% covered and it knows what to do in every case (finances, PRs, sponsorships etc). Mail app is pretty much dead for me.\n- GitHub issues covered, bots investigate, try to reproduce and open a PR\n- Controls T3 https://t.co/iBN5Np25dJ", "url": "https://x.com/orcdev/status/2116880629451149374"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116878899791396865"]}, "author_id": "1131631949641060352", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:06:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116879538500120959"], "id": "2116879538500120959", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11/1/2026 Update, @LEBcando commentary about the TECH WATCH privacy buffet: ads that read your wallet, terms that changed overnight, and watermarks you can't see\ud83d\udc40\n(source links in comments)\n\nCAPITALIST SOCIALISM:\n\nHappy Sunday. \n\nStarting today, \ud835\udd4f Money @XMoney may use your https://t.co/wELCjuWpnF", "url": "https://x.com/LEBcando/status/2116879538500120959"}, {"author_id": "1037725470630891520", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:03:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116878892711686177"], "id": "2116878892711686177", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4713529994", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116873288656031928", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@thesighsrikar Ha, might be worth trying it yourself first so you know what he'd actually use it for. I use Grok Bot every day for my inbox, scheduling and errands, and it just runs in the background. 2 weeks free with my invite if you want to test before buying:\nhttps://t.co/Mznq32dnzi", "url": "https://x.com/johnherzog/status/2116878892711686177"}, {"article": {"title": "The prompt my wife used to build a full homeschool week with Grok Bot"}, "author_id": "1891252793177989121", "created_at": "2026-11-01T13:03:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116878875489673459"], "id": "2116878875489673459", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Here's the exact prompt my wife used to build a full homeschool week. Copy it and fill in the brackets. #homeschool #homeschooling @grok https://t.co/PhzEPI6AjC", "url": "https://x.com/JonathanRo7398/status/2116878875489673459"}, {"author_id": "48963736", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:53:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116876390775586858"], "id": "2116876390775586858", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1979988913792876544", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116853189442211922", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@GeorgeSiosi @NotionHQ Can we grok bot the NotionAI agents so we can talk to hybrid teams in Notion\u2019s \u201cSlack\u201d ?\n\nIf Notion and Grok bot had a baby, with a Slack, a Calendar and an email app, that\u2019s it for me, I do not need to use any other platform.", "url": "https://x.com/DenisQS_/status/2116876390775586858"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["16_2116874734298132481"]}, "author_id": "12645352", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:47:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116874740245692698"], "id": "2116874740245692698", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 441, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ran out of Grok Bot usage yesterday and my inbox is a mess this morning. I\u2019m going to end up upgrading aren\u2019t I? https://t.co/IY4K0jyMAA", "url": "https://x.com/JoshDaws/status/2116874740245692698"}, {"author_id": "1947658827316232194", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:45:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116874297243562416"], "id": "2116874297243562416", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1941189448386977792", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116135904733462554", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@mdnlabs Same boat \u2014 I handed Grok Bot my X + fitness + money stack.\n\nIt posts for me while I lift, ships product replies, and helped me get Vault (my \u20b90 finance iPhone app) out the door.\n\nOps bot &gt; content calendar.", "url": "https://x.com/sk_boora/status/2116874297243562416"}, {"author_id": "2084537269382184960", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:41:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116873347208487297"], "id": "2116873347208487297", "in_reply_to_user_id": "30018058", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2102412767307194786", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PayPal @Meta @Muse Inbox me with your cash app or PayPal to get it blessed right rn \ud83d\ude0d", "url": "https://x.com/blessings0xb4/status/2116873347208487297"}, {"author_id": "91079890", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:37:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116872139416776880"], "id": "2116872139416776880", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83e\udd2f Real people, real Grok Bot setups:\n\n1. @BenyaminHolley: a site-visitor-to-outbound workflow with Slack alerts\n2. @Texas_Twins_Dad: a phishing-blocking bot for the family\n3. @SuttlerL46660: a maintenance calendar and receipt log for a small Idaho farm\n\nWhich would you copy? \ud83d\udc47", "url": "https://x.com/JitendraBlogger/status/2116872139416776880"}, {"author_id": "1037725470630891520", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:08:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116864891382641004"], "id": "2116864891382641004", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1214148777096826880", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116858295256498568", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@AITechHorizon Depends what you'd hand it, but for me it was worth it. Grok Bot handles my inbox, scheduling and research every day on its own computer, no setup, and it actually finishes. Easiest way to decide is to test it, 2 weeks free:\nhttps://t.co/Mznq32dnzi", "url": "https://x.com/johnherzog/status/2116864891382641004"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116863409077489664"]}, "author_id": "1918346924463202304", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:02:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116863497581613458"], "id": "2116863497581613458", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 33, "impression_count": 1311, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115018135396905000", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "How is nobody talking about this... my 7 Grok Bots were waking up every single hour and wasting 1,176 runs a week on literally nothing\n\nso I just rewired the whole team inside Elon Musk's Grok Bot with one prompt and dropped it here for free\n\nhere's the exact setup step by step: https://t.co/4J1ShBtt07 https://t.co/O8VCVrFI3a", "url": "https://x.com/gippp69/status/2116863497581613458"}, {"author_id": "1732170258830524416", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:00:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116862849964503381"], "id": "2116862849964503381", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "official playbooks live here\n\nhttps://t.co/UTzEfWVXsm\n\nGrok Bot for Work names four:\n\u2192 Inbox Manager\n\u2192 Calendar EA\n\u2192 Intel Scout\n\u2192 Bot Boss as the front door\n\nsteal the shape.\ndon't invent jobs.", "url": "https://x.com/perpycode/status/2116862849964503381"}, {"article": {"title": "One Person, Seven Projects, Zero Dropped Balls: How Grok Bot Runs My Business"}, "author_id": "145730465", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:55:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116861666281373730"], "id": "2116861666281373730", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 2276, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "How One Person Runs a Newsletter, a Podcast and Six Apps With a Proactive AI Assistant https://t.co/eHncXv7qqF", "url": "https://x.com/mattpheus/status/2116861666281373730"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2116861525705023488"]}, "author_id": "1691433918296207361", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:54:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116861537453219875"], "id": "2116861537453219875", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 11, "impression_count": 397, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115845789461123466", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "10 USE CASES. 7 ROLES. ONE BIG PROBLEM: HANDOFFS.\n\nThis is a good look at how versatile Grok Bot can be.\n\nThe video covers 10 practical use cases:\n\n\u2192 A second brain for saving and researching content\n\u2192 Bots that build product features\n\u2192 Agent swarms managing 10+ agents\n\u2192 https://t.co/Z6WbRqAmZB https://t.co/5uEu5OrIKp", "url": "https://x.com/k0dzilla/status/2116861537453219875"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116860688677076992"]}, "author_id": "1941189448386977792", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:51:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116860694742090001"], "id": "2116860694742090001", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 1151, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116135904733462554", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Week 1 of Grok @Bot:\n\nTook 5 minutes to setup.\n\nGoal: Get monetized on \ud835\udd4f in November and make more original videos.\n\n&gt; 1 month for $15 \u2705\n&gt; Setup content database \u2705\n&gt; Connected my @superx_so account \u2705\n&gt; Connected X, Notion, Gmail, and Calendar \u2705\n&gt; Setup multiple X-growth bots https://t.co/lQXshlZyEn https://t.co/bW7YXDKw1m", "url": "https://x.com/mdnlabs/status/2116860694742090001"}, {"author_id": "1037725470630891520", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:37:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116857118464909761"], "id": "2116857118464909761", "in_reply_to_user_id": "370613056", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116852268691525659", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@simon_bullows @grok @NousResearch @OpenBot_ Can't speak to Openbot, but if you're still weighing options, Grok Bot is what I use daily. No servers or bringing your own models; it has its own computer and browser and handles my inbox, scheduling and research. 2 weeks free:\nhttps://t.co/Mznq32dnzi", "url": "https://x.com/johnherzog/status/2116857118464909761"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116854141158879234"]}, "author_id": "145730465", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:28:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116854974130839933"], "id": "2116854974130839933", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 723, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I fired myself as my wife's help desk. Then a dad named Rob showed me the next job.\n\nWhen I posted that my wife's Grok Bot now asks mine instead of texting me, Rob replied with his setup. A bot for each daughter watches the school email and flags what needs a parent, and he's the https://t.co/1AFClCtjEm", "url": "https://x.com/mattpheus/status/2116854974130839933"}, {"author_id": "1780254371462156288", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:27:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116854663073210726"], "id": "2116854663073210726", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116853815894806603", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2116305829381263528", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot My Grok Bot CEO tested the spam filter of my Grok Bot Inbox. And it worked!\n\nhttps://t.co/5UWhLomFbS", "url": "https://x.com/Frank_AI_Lab/status/2116854663073210726"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2116853743140384769"]}, "author_id": "1780254371462156288", "created_at": "2026-11-01T11:24:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116853815894806603"], "id": "2116853815894806603", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot tried to phish my other Grok Bot.\n\nOn purpose.\n\nMy chief-of-staff bot sent 4 test mails to my inbo